# Migration safety scanner - acknowledged intentional-risk migrations.
#
# `bun run db:migration-safety` scans `migration.sql` files for destructive
# operations (DROP TABLE, DROP COLUMN, ALTER COLUMN ... TYPE, ADD COLUMN ...
# NOT NULL without DEFAULT). Migrations listed here have been reviewed and
# intentionally accepted, so the scanner emits an `INFO:` (acknowledged) line
# instead of `WARN:`.
#
# Format
#   <migration_dir_name>  <freeform reason>
#
# Rules
#   - One acknowledged migration per non-blank, non-comment line.
#   - Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#   - The migration name is the directory name under
#     `packages/server/prisma/migrations/`.
#   - Reason text after the first whitespace is shown alongside the INFO line.

20260408223838_convert_string_fields_to_enums  Reviewed: ALTER COLUMN ... TYPE narrowings of spells/equipment/magic-items text columns to enums; USING cast covers existing rows.
20260409120000_add_monster_spells_table  Reviewed: DROP COLUMN monsters.spellcasting after backfill into monster_spells in the same migration.
